WEBVTT

00:02:27.310 --> 00:02:30.688
so after the surgery, every hour,

00:02:30.730 --> 00:02:32.982
the doctors and nurses would come in,

00:02:32.982 --> 00:02:34.650
unwrap the wound,

00:02:34.692 --> 00:02:37.945
apply a gel and search
for a heartbeat in the muscle.

00:02:38.863 --> 00:02:43.326
Every time I would make them put up
this big white sheet to block my vision,

00:02:43.367 --> 00:02:46.913
because from what I could tell,
it wasn't a pretty sight.

00:02:47.663 --> 00:02:50.082
My leg was essentially a giant open wound.

00:02:51.083 --> 00:02:53.377
When the doctors and nurses
were back there,

00:02:53.419 --> 00:02:56.547
my wife would be back there with them
trying to cheer me up.

00:02:57.131 --> 00:02:58.591
"It looks so good."

00:02:59.133 --> 00:03:00.468
(Laughter)